    },
    "comment" : {
      "undefined" : "An animal or a microbe (possibly at a development stage) causes a disease for a host plant (or a plant part, possibly at a development stage). Constraint: either the disease or the plant must be explicitly known (both cannot be anonymous at the same time)."
