    },
    "subClasses" : [ "25" ],
    "comment" : {
      "undefined" : "An animal or microbe is a commensal of an animal. The commensal (the species that benefits from the association) may obtain from the host nutrients, shelter, support or a means of locomotion. The host is not significantly affected."
